# "This creature can't block." Bot2's Elvish Mystic attacks on turn 4. Bot1 may not block with Forsaken Miner (refused),
# while its Ornithopter, in the same combat, can (the positive control): the Mystic is blocked and Bot1 takes no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Forsaken Miner
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Swamp x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Forsaken Miner.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Elvish Mystic > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Forsaken Miner > Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Elvish Mystic)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Forsaken Miner; Ornithopter; Swamp
